      "name": "Arun Joy Thekkiniyath",
      "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:09:40.931Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When Valid Upto field in Item Price is left empty, there is no issue. But when it is set to a future date, the price of that item is not listed in POS. Has anyone faced this issue? What is the expected behaviour here?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/3/e3e6fd503f6cc075d91a20d23b9fbb302be5efc0.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e3e6fd503f6cc075d91a20d23b9fbb302be5efc0\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-03 at 3.09.26 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e3e6fd503f6cc075d91a20d23b9fbb302be5efc0_2_690x403.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-03 at 3.09.26 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"ww7hgEr5mikHBil7l17j6Nz3WZq\" width=\"690\" height=\"403\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e3e6fd503f6cc075d91a20d23b9fbb302be5efc0_2_690x403.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e3e6fd503f6cc075d91a20d23b9fbb302be5efc0_2_1035x604.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/3/e3e6fd503f6cc075d91a20d23b9fbb302be5efc0_2_1380x806.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"BFBDBB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-11-03 at 3.09.26 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1123 89.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/1/213dc5ca4149313d42af6453445c59a9275ae22e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/213dc5ca4149313d42af6453445c59a9275ae22e\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-03 at 3.10.03 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/1/2