    {
      "id": 486473,
      "username": "SherinKR",
      "name": "Sherin K R",
      "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:24:12.004Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s showing the customer selection. Before adding item to cart you need to select the customer. It’s because there can be custom price list for customer and to get all those render Need to select customer prior to Item selection. The same thing you can find on Sales Invoice aswell.</p>",
