      "name": "Arun Joy Thekkiniyath",
      "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:54:17.572Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Even after selecting the customer, price is not updated, it works only when Valid Upto field in Item Price is left empty or set to current day.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/9/79dd2bcccc51068bd849ea3feb893142ed705d8f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/79dd2bcccc51068bd849ea3feb893142ed705d8f\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-14 at 4.18.55 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79dd2bcccc51068bd849ea3feb893142ed705d8f_2_690x436.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-14 at 4.18.55 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"ho3D6P1yIYVvEmuRm1Uc4fobsMT\" width=\"690\" height=\"436\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79dd2bcccc51068bd849ea3feb893142ed705d8f_2_690x436.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79dd2bcccc51068bd849ea3feb893142ed705d8f_2_1035x654.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/9/79dd2bcccc51068bd849ea3feb893142ed705d8f_2_1380x872.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"DAD9D8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-11-14 at 4.18.55 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1552×981 182 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1bee2302304c3474b4d739039e53f04c302066be.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1bee2302304c3474b4d739039e53f04c302066be\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-14 at 4.19.59 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1bee2302304c3474b4d739039e53f04c302066be_2_690x436.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot 2